WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:37.320
I'm Kurata Sana, 1st year Junior
high school student.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.070
Manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:43.620
Aoki Award winning Mama and
squirrel Maro-chan.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:47.080
My best friend I met in the
bathroom, Fuka.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.210
Mysterious white bat, Babbit!

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:52.000
On New Years,
you have to have a kotatsu.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.170
Naozumi-kun who was having a
delicious life in New York.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:57.050
He's now my important partner.

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:01.100
Hayama Akito, my best friend
I think...

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.430
Now he's going out with Fuka.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.770
Naozumi... um...

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.650
it's about Sana -chan...

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:16.150
The reason why Sana-chan
couldn't say devil...

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:20.620
was because of a guy named Hayama-kun.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:27.080
So This Kind Of Day
Has Come!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.540
Kurata Sana's mask is taken off.

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.500
Kurata Sana spits
at the American staff?!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.960
She threatens Naozumi-kun to go
out with her.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:37.300
That is so horrible!

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.880
How could they print such things
when it's not true!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.220
How is she doing with her work?

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:47.480
That is... the last commercial she
was scheduled for was canceled.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:51.810
They said an idol who is snooty
won't fit into the image of their commercial.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:56.150
No matter how dense Sana-chan is,
she still won't be able to stand it.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.530
She hasn't come out of her bedroom
since this morning.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.820
Good morning, Rei-kun, Mama!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:01.910
Sana-chan!

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.240
She looks fine, doesn't she, Sagami?

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.370
You're right.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.000
What channel is this morning's
anime in?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.790
Ah! Don't look at this!

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.130
Eh, really?

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.670
Ah! A new issue of Focus.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:17.880
Not this either!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.970
Hey, Rei-kun!
Your slipper is dirty!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:22.890
Sorry, sorry,
I was looking at it first.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.510
Then I'll watch TV.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:30.560
So it looks like Sana-chan
doesn't have any jobs at all.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:35.150
Well, I guess it's all good for
other child idols.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.900
So I don't have any work at all?

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.820
That's... I'm sorry, Sana-chan.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.120
It's because I don't have any
power that it turned out like this.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.000
Tell me, Rei-kun!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.790
If I knew about this earlier, I
wouldn't have woken up this early!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.380
Tell me these kind of things earlier!

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.840
Ah, it's been a long time since my
last break time.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.380
Uh, this is not really a break
since you have no job.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.090
Having a break is fun!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.680
It's not a break!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.800
It's a waste of time to go back to
sleep... I wonder what I should play...

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.060
Before you play, don't you have
something to do, Sana?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.440
Yeah. Before playing?
I wonder what it is.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.730
A child doing something before
she plays...

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.860
Go to school.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:18.270
School? It's nostalgic.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:22.070
You're a junior high school
student! Go to school!

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.070
And I thought that I could rest today.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:30.120
Hmm, Science, English and Music.
I wonder what we're doing in music.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.960
Harmonica, Ocarina?
Or is it Ukulele??!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.250
There's no time for that!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.920
Oh well, let's
just stuff it all in!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.760
Uniform, uniform... there.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.720
This is what makes me a pretty
junior high school student.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.390
I don't have time for this!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.930
First and second period is
Sengoku-sensei!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.940
Oh, I forgot how to wear it.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.020
You liar.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.940
Sensei, are you sure this is
alright?!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.690
If she has no work, she's an
ordinary junior high school student.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:02.400
It's obvious she must go to school.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.780
Ah, this feels good.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:08.700
But may be students who believe in
the tabloids and be suspicious of Sana.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:14.000
If she'll get hurt, I think it's better for
her not to go to school.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.920
Sana will be alright.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.460
My child wouldn't get upset so easily.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.420
Bye! I'm taking off!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.050
Sana-chan,
I will drive you to school.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.760
I'm fine, I'm fine!
Bye, Rei-kun!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.890
Ah, Sana-chan...

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.430
There, you see?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.140
I think she's lightheaded rather
than strong.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.140
Did you see today's Wideshow?

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.230
So Sana-chan is really being
stuck up?

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.600
I wonder if it's true.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:40.650
Hey you guys,
would you just cut it out?

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.240
That's right! You know that
Sana-chan isn't stuck-up.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.240
But then sometimes I feel that
way too.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.280
Tsuyoshi, snap out of it!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.830
How can you guys not believe her?!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.620
Yes, yes, that's how I feel.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.710
But let's ask her the truth.
Maybe we should ask Sana-chan.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.080
Snap out of it!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.710
Soromatabaggi! Long time no see!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.920
Sana-chan!

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.460
Everyone's Kurata Sana is here!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.340
Hey. Is that Kurata?

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.090
Kurata is back in school!

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.890
So the rumor was true that
she had no jobs.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.350
Yeah.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:18.060
Good morning, Sana-chan.
I guess it's hard for you right now.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.940
Ah, it's ok.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.190
Is Fuka still in the hospital?

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:26.150
Yeah... and Akito-kun's
suspension hasn't ended yet.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.450
I see.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:33.080
In a long time, when I go to
school, those two are not here...

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.290
Hey, Sana-chan, is it true that
you spat in America?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.750
No way,
don't believe those things.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.500
They just edited the picture when
I was eating a burger from Manhattan.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.970
Wait, why do they have such
a picture?

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.300
These days this anime is getting
to be a lie.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:53.510
Then what about the thing of you
threatening Naozumi-kun and now...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.640
That's a lie.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:59.350
Yeah, I didn't believe
you would do such a thing.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:00.560
Me too.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.230
Thank you, Tsuyoshi-kun,
Aya-chan.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:06.400
But didn't you kinda believe it
though?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.690
Yeah, just a little.

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:11.110
Hmm? Who?
Who was that just now?

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.030
Kurata, why aren't you in the drama?

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.410
Um, that's well... um...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:21.170
Today's society's structure is
very complicated.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.210
If this one stands,
then the other can't stand.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.460
And if you think
you're going to stand,

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:30.550
you suddenly sit.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.050
Prepare 10 Zabutons!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:37.220
It's the same height as me

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.430
This is how the society works...

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.980
Excuse me for today's song!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.320
Oh no!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.860
The bell already rang.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.200
There are even students from
other classes!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.280
We're sorry!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:58.160
Bye, Sana-chan!
I'll see you later, ok?

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.790
- See you all later!
- Ah, Aya-chan!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.580
Excuse us!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.880
So I thought it was kinda rowdy.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.840
The idol is here.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.920
Huuuh... what do you mean?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:14.390
Hayama-kun who was suspended,
an idol who's scandalized...

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.220
These days the school's image is
getting worse.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.680
Be quiet!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:22.270
I don't care what you do at work, but this is a school!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:26.230
If you stand here with this
immature mould then you'll cause problems.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.780
I don't have an immature
personality in this school.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:33.070
Oh, then show it in your attitude.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.780
Listen attentively to your lessons.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.620
Yes! Leave it to me.

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:44.960
Ok, so open your books to page 87.
Today we'll talk about photosynthesis.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.790
When plants get sunlight and
make glucose

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.300
then this is called
photosynthesis.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:55.050
Photosynthesis occurs in
the plant's chlorophyll.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.180
Ah no way, I'm taking a break.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:08:59.720
Yes?

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.430
Fuka-chan! Are you doing well?

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:06.650
Oh, it's Tsuyoshi-kun and
Aya-chan! Thanks for coming!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:10.110
Today it's not just us.
There's also another person.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.230
Huh, who?

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.530
Guess.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.030
It can't be Akito.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.950
Huh, what is that smell?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.910
This is...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.870
Sana! It's you!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.580
You got it!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.790
Wow, how did you know Fuka?

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.590
Nowadays since I'm unable to see,
my sense of smell has gotten better.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.420
Fuka, are you a dog?

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.220
It's been a long time, Sana!

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.890
Long time no see! You look well!

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.560
Seems that you're having a hard
time in the celebrity world.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:47.140
Well, I deserve what I get!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:50.400
Oh yeah, Matsui Fuka, here you go.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.570
What is it?

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.110
It's today's notes.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.240
Uh?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:57.240
Remember the time when you took
notes for me?

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:00.120
- Well, it's a revenge.
- No, it's a thank you.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.990
It's the first time I listened
seriously to a lesson.

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:06.790
And I used so much of my brain
that I thought I was going to faint.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.420
Thanks, Sana. You saved me.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.210
Wait, wait, let me see.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.720
Photosynthesis...

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:20.510
Sana-chan, this is the same exact
thing like in the text book.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.970
What, no way!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.270
Wait, maybe she just copied what
Sengoku-sensei said.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:29.100
And you didn't even write one
kanji, you can't even write it well.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:33.110
I can spark English? Spark?

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.900
I think it means that if you
use too much English

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.900
then your
head will start sparking.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.410
That's totally wrong!

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:43.120
- Yeah and even that's in Katakana.
- Can all you write is Katakana?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.870
It seems that I'm not really good
at writing alpha hat.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.370
It's alphabet!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.620
Now let's hear
the native accent in America.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.250
I can speak English very well!

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.920
I guess America is so much
different from here.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:59.180
Sana-chan, are you sure you just
came back from America? That's just...

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:01.590
Well, who cares,
that's Sana-chan.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.430
It's funny. No bad.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.600
Fuka...

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.970
Oh everyone, thank you very much.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.980
Good afternoon.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.310
Fuka, the doctor is here.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.560
Matsui-san, we're ready.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.030
It's ok, right?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:21.410
Today's the day Fuka-chan can
take off her bandage. Oh, I just read that.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.960
Ok, open your eyes slowly.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.300
How is it, can you see?

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:46.140
Fuka? How is it? Can you see?

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:49.230
Yeah! I can see!
I can see very well!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:53.650
It's alright now. Now she can be
discharged out of the hospital.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.610
Thank you very much.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.570
I'm glad, Fuka-chan.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:59.320
Yes, thank you.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.780
We have to hurry and tell Hayama.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.660
Lady, where's the phone?

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.700
Hey everyone,
I have something to tell you.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:20.420
{parte b}

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.300
This is an encore...

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:26.390
A one a two a one two on!

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.180
Hieizan's 'ei' letter is

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.180
It spell by many characters

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.150
Hieizan's 'ei' letter is

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.190
It spell by many characters

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.360
A one a two a one two two!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:44.150
Nowadays cheating is
the big thing so 'don't do it'

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:47.160
Say that to your father and mother

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.240
Nowadays cheating is
the big thing so 'don't do it'

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.160
Say that to your father and mother

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:56.420
A one a two a one two three!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.170
Look at the right, look at the
front, look at the left

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:02.170
But even if you do that, watch out
for cars

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.130
Look at the right, look at the
front, look at the left

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.140
But even if you do that,
watch out for cars

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.350
Since it's windy,
try not to catch a cold.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.600
Hayama-kun and Fuka will
never go out again.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.650
Everyone please understand this.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:22.530
The reason why Fuka is
like this is Hayama-kun.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:24.030
That's not right.

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:27.740
Akito-kun saved Fuka-chan from
a bunch of gangsters.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:31.120
But I heard he's been bad since
elementary school.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.830
Well, that's...

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.370
- It's true that he was bad.
- Sana-chan...

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:39.130
But that's the past. Now he's
really a nice guy.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.170
It's hard to find someone as nice as him.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.340
No! He's always been nice ever
since elementary school.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.680
Yeah, he's a little distorted
and that part hasn't changed even now.

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:52.310
And it made me want to scream
'Damn you little' and it made me really mad.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.560
Sana-chan, you're off topic!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:58.310
Ah... but that was basically my
misunderstanding.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.070
And he's not the type of person
who would try to make people understand him...

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:05.320
every time there's a misunderstanding. I think this time it's the same thing.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.240
But since the school thought
it was Hayama-kun's responsibility

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.200
he got suspended.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:15.540
Suspension. Akito... for me...

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.660
Fuka...

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:22.340
The one who was frustrated the
most because he couldn't protect Fuka is...

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:26.590
He's the kind of person who would
take it onto himself...

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.130
- He...
- Sana-chan...

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.310
Matsui-san, the doctor has
something to tell you.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.140
Yes, I'll be there in a second.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:37.480
Well, that's the story, so...

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.730
...please don't say anything
about Hayama-kun in front of Fuka.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.360
Thanks for today, bye.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.900
Hey, lady!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:48.530
Akito-kun is completely cast as
the bad guy, isn't he?

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.700
Akito got suspended because of me.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.830
Akito...

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.670
he didn't say one word about that...

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:03.380
He's the kind of person who would
take it onto himself.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:09.840
Yes?

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:12.970
Hello? Akito-kun. Fuka-chan is
out of the hospital now.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.260
She's alright.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:16.560
She said that she'll come to
school tomorrow.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.600
You could come to school
tomorrow too, right?

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.440
Sana-chan is back, everyone is
together again, right?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.690
Sana?

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.150
Hello, Akito-kun?

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.820
Ah thank you, Tsuyoshi.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:28.570
By the way, Akito-kun...
Eh? He hung up.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:32.030
Sana... Sana's back at school.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.070
Is it Matsui-san?

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.990
Yeah, she got her bandage off and
is out of the hospital.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.620
I see. I'm glad.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.540
Yeah, me too.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.290
Are you going somewhere with
Matsui-san?

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.960
No, I'm going to the dojo.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.210
Akito...

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:51.430
Your father thinks that you've
done your best in this matter.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:55.890
So, let's have sushi tonight
to celebrate Matsui-san's recovery.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.220
Sorry. I don't feel like eating.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.600
I see.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.860
Hayama refused to eat sushi?!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.270
I can't believe it...

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.480
He has a lot on his mind.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.110
Wow, that's great.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:14.620
Did something happen to him?

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.590
Good morning.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.260
Both of us haven't come to school
for a while.

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.140
Should we walk together for a bit?

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.180
Thanks a lot.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.100
Why are you thanking me?

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.060
Coming every day to the hospital,

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.690
I really appreciated it.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.280
You're not being serious
with me, are you?

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:53.360
I was told not to come anymore.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.320
Yeah...
but I'm really glad you did.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.540
And... I'm sorry...

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.450
There's no reason for you to be
sorry.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.790
No... There are a lot of reasons.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.790
I never knew that you were
suspended.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.880
Why didn't you tell me?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.510
It's not really a thing to
tell you.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.180
Oh yeah,
you're that kind of a person.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.350
Really, just like Sana says...

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:22.390
"He's the kind of person who would
take it onto himself."

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.770
So I thought I'll take some of
the weight off of you.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:31.400
I don't think that it's kindness
to be nice to a person that you don't like.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.610
Do you remember saying that
to me before?

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:39.950
I like you because you're that
kind of a person.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:44.040
So, please don't be nice to me
anymore.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:49.080
The one person you have to be
nice to is not me.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.550
Isn't that right?

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.340
So I'll see you later.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:04.810
Everyone, long time no see!
I'm the principal.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:09.690
I'm very relieved that Fuka-san
is not seriously injured.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.900
Yes, thank you very much.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:15.320
This matter happened when I was on
a business trip.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:20.280
And it seemed as if everything was
Hayama-kun's fault.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:26.830
The truth is Hayama-kun tried to
save Fuka from gangsters of another school

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:30.040
and so we decided that
Fuka-san's injury was an accident.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.750
- Huh?!
- Principal!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.380
Today I wanted to clear up that
misunderstanding.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.720
So... that was just an accident?

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.800
It seems so.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.850
But if Hayama-kun didn't take
Fuka to the arcade

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.180
then this would never have
happened.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:52.860
Anyway, we now know that Fuka's
injury is not caused directly by Hayama.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.570
But that's the only thing
we can agree with.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.900
No, that's alright.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:01.740
Principal, with that kind of
lenient attitude, the other students...

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:06.240
Hayama-kun already received
a 10 day suspension!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:10.960
Sensei, can you please not judge
a student by personality?

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.500
Yes, I understand.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:13.920
This is the truth.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:18.800
Hayama-san and Fuka-san, let's just try to forget this awful matter

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.010
and please concentrate on your studies.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.220
Yes.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.180
- Yes...
- Why does the dad have to answer?!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.720
So about what happened...

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:32.190
Everyone is alright alright,
don't you agree?

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:34.190
This is not the time to do this!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:39.610
- Excuse us.
- Fuka!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.530
Are you going home already?

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:46.030
Yeah, my eyes are not really that
well yet and I have to go to the hospital.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.830
I see, hurry and come to school
normally.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.790
Yeah.

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.750
Excuse me.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.290
Akito-kun.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.100
Please don't be
nice to me anymore...

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:09.060
The one person you have to be nice
to is not me...

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.600
Not me...

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.610
Ok, Fuka, we have to go now.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:19.360
Alright. See you later!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.450
Akito.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.540
Hayama...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.330
I wonder what happened!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:34.750
I think she's really having
a hard time in school.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.960
Sana-chan! A guest for you!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:40.130
I don't want to
see anyone right now.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.050
Naozumi-kun!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.430
What's Naozumi-kun doing here?!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:51.930
Let's go, Sagami!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.730
Where are we going?

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.350
- We're not going to interfere!
- Sensei!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:59.110
I heard that your drama's filming
is over now.

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:01.110
Looks like it's going to turn out well.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.450
I heard that it's going to be one of
your major titles.

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:08.410
You've worked so hard!
It makes my face bigger.

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.870
No, you use that in front of
royalty!

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.950
In this case, it's the nose,
the nose.

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.960
Sorry that I had no power to
help you...

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.210
No, Naozumi-kun,

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.380
it's my fault that I was turned
down for my part.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.470
Because you couldn't say the word
'devil'.

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:28.430
Oh really? I forgot.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:31.260
I heard that he was called
a 'devil'.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:35.190
Hayama-kun was called a 'devil',

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:37.020
that's why you couldn't say it.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.360
Naozumi-kun,
where did you hear that?

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.320
When I heard that, I finally understood your feelings

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:46.110
that you still love Hayama-kun.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.570
That's wrong! You're wrong,
Naozumi-kun!

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.780
Yeah, I like Hayama,

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:53.200
but it's not
in a love kind of way.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:56.120
It's more like a person who shares
the same suffering as me.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:59.040
And it's more like brother and
sister.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.500
Right now I like Naozumi-kun...

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:02.920
That's enough.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.710
Enough already, Sana-chan.

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:08.300
If you keep on saying that, then
the matter will only get worse.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:09.850
I didn't mean to do that.

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:13.680
Let's break up.

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:16.730
Naozumi-kun...

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.600
I'm never going to say it again.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:23.900
But I will always love you,
Sana-chan.

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:26.110
Just believe in that.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:27.320
Naozumi-kun...

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:30.780
Goodbye.

